  "body": "## Summary\n- records the authenticated, LLM-disabled NotepadNext cold scan and independent certification verification\n- advances PR5 to COLD SCAN PASS / CALIBRATION PARTIAL without weakening A1-A8\n- corrects the accepted acquisition lineage to the exact 1,928-provider-blob package\n- adds lightweight receipts and calibration evidence; large sealed ZIPs remain in canonical Google Drive storage\n\n## Verified evidence\n- exact acquisition: 1,928/1,928 blobs; SHA-256 4a1343f4f56500ba850162039e7483e2f17f894be6493f5afbaacdf25c2c44a3\n- cold certification: 12/12 files independently verified; SHA-256 6c0d476e2dd7a63481cf388e6d654798ffa26f8c72ce9760a8bd60667b075ce3\n- JSON receipts parse successfully\n- git diff --cached --check passes\n\n## Remaining gate\nGeneric v0.21 calibration fixes and a fresh sealed rerun are required before PR5 convergence.",
